@startuml ARCH-02d-服务端粗粒度逻辑单元课堂简图
' 课堂汇报简图，来源：ARCH-02b-服务端逻辑分层与职责图.puml
title 服务端：模块化粗粒度逻辑单元 + 独立 Worker
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction

cloud "Android / Windows\n客户端" as Client #E1F5FE
component "HTTPS Ingress\nTLS、限流、路由" as Ingress #ECEFF1

package "少量粗粒度逻辑单元" #F8F9FA {
  component "身份与同步\n账号、设备、revision、cursor" as Sync #E8F3EF
  component "AI / RAG 网关\n证据合同、ModelAdapter" as AI #FFF1E5
  component "任务与审计 Worker\nlease、重试、清理" as Worker #EDE7F6
  Sync -[hidden]right-> AI
  AI -[hidden]right-> Worker
}

database "PostgreSQL\n当前态、变更流、任务表" as PG #ECEFF1
cloud "受控模型 API" as Model #FFF3E0

Client --> Ingress : REST/JSON + SSE
Ingress --> Sync : 同步 API
Ingress --> AI : 问答 API
Sync --> PG : 单事务
AI --> PG : 请求状态
Worker --> PG : lease
AI -right-> Model : 适配器

note bottom of Worker
一期可同机部署，不采用细粒度微服务群。
长任务持久化，但不默认引入消息代理或独立事件总线。
end note
@enduml
